This position brings together a defined set of responsibilities into a single point of coordination, ensuring the team continues to respond effectively to commercial and trade priorities across the business. &nbsp;

The role acts as the connective layer across marketing channels: building visibility on what each channel owner is delivering, translating trade and commercial priorities into marketing action, and representing Global Marketing in trade conversations. &nbsp;

This is a newly created, fixed-term role designed to provide focused trade and commercial marketing support to the Global Marketing team during a period of maternity leave cover.

